---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="" title="The Invisible Suffering | Ask Astro Raja">

  <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg text-center border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-brand-saffron font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-6 text-sm md:text-base">
        The Invisible Suffering
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy mb-6 tracking-tight">Nobody knows how heavy the mind is.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-text leading-relaxed font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        "I smile outside but I'm drowning inside."
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTENT -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-16">
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-brand max-w-none text-brand-navy">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">The Burden of the "Strong One"</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">
          You are the rock. You help everyone, but nobody helps you. You are completely surrounded by people, yet you feel deeply, fundamentally alone. You are profoundly tired of being strong all the time, but you don't know how to stop.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 border-l-4 border-brand-saffron p-8 my-10 rounded-r-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">The Invisible Symptom</h3>
          <p class="mb-0">
            This isolation is not an accident; it is the natural byproduct of a specific behavioral loop. Your code dictates that vulnerability equals weakness, and your value is derived solely from your utility to others. By never allowing anyone to see your cracks, you ensure that no one ever steps in to hold you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Pattern</h3>
        <p class="mb-6">
          The cycle looks like this: You suppress your own needs to manage a crisis -> People praise your resilience -> You internally build a wall of resentment that no one helps you -> You isolate yourself further -> When you finally crack, people are shocked because "you always seemed so fine."
        </p>

        <p class="mb-10">
          This pattern will literally drain the life out of you. You cannot break it by just taking a vacation. You have to rewrite the baseline code that equates your worth with your suffering.
        </p>

        <div class="text-center mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-brand-border">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Diagnose Your Operating System</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Stop carrying the weight of the world alone. Understand the behavioral blueprint that isolated you, and get the exact daily system to rewrite it.
          </p>
          <a href="/get-reading" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:scale-105 hover:bg-brand-purple transition-transform shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl">
            Discover My Pattern
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
